//www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p><em>Hint: in (c), look at what the premise is waiting for.</em></p>","file":"ch02-negation-and-classical-logic/06-finding-derivations.html"}